+/** 櫃買中心可轉換公司債登錄資料（國內 bond_ISSBD5、海外 bond_ISSBD6）。上市、上櫃公司的可轉債都在櫃買登錄。 */
+export const TPEX_CB_DOMESTIC_URL='https://www.tpex.org.tw/openapi/v1/bond_ISSBD5_data';
+export const TPEX_CB_OVERSEAS_URL='https://www.tpex.org.tw/openapi/v1/bond_ISSBD6_data';
+const CB_CURRENCY=Object.freeze({'1':'TWD','2':'USD'});
+const cbNumber=v=>{const t=String(v??'').trim().replaceAll(',','');if(!t)return null;const n=Number(t);return Number.isFinite(n)?n:null;};
+export function parseCbRegistry(rows,{sourceUrl,kind,capturedAt}={}){
+  if(!Array.isArray(rows))throw Error('CB_REGISTRY_SCHEMA');
+  const out=[];
+  for(const r of rows){
+    const issuer=String(r?.IssuerCode??'').trim(),id=String(r?.BondCode??'').trim();
+    if(!/^\d{4,6}$/.test(issuer)||!id)continue;
+    const price=cbNumber(r['Conversion/ExchangePriceAtIssuance']),name=String(r.ShortName??'').trim();
+    out.push({issuer,id,name:name&&name!=='無'?name:null,kind,currency:CB_CURRENCY[String(r.Currency??'').trim()]||null,currencyCode:String(r.Currency??'').trim(),
+      issueDate:officialDay(r.IssueDate),maturityDate:officialDay(r.MaturityDate),issuedFace:cbNumber(r.IssueAmount),outstandingFace:cbNumber(r.OutstandingAmount),
+      conversionPriceAtIssue:price>0?price:null,conversionStart:officialDay(r['Conversion/ExchangePeriodStartDate']),conversionEnd:officialDay(r['Conversion/ExchangePeriodEndDate']),
+      putDate:officialDay(r.PutOptionDate),putPrice:cbNumber(r.PutOptionPrice),registryDate:officialDay(r.Date),sourceUrl,capturedAt});
+  }
+  if(!out.length)throw Error('CB_REGISTRY_NO_ROWS');
+  return out;
+}
+const cbTasks=new Map();
+export async function collectCbRegistry({read,write,fetchImpl=fetch,now=Date.now()}){
+  const localDay=new Date(now+8*3600000).toISOString().slice(0,10),key=`panel:cb-registry:v1:${localDay}`,old=await read(key);
+  if(old?.fresh)return old.payload;
+  if(cbTasks.has(key))return cbTasks.get(key);
+  const task=(async()=>{
+    const bonds=[],errors=[],sources=[],capturedAt=new Date(now).toISOString();
+    for(const [kind,sourceUrl] of [['domestic',TPEX_CB_DOMESTIC_URL],['overseas',TPEX_CB_OVERSEAS_URL]]){
+      try{const r=await fetchImpl(sourceUrl,{headers:{Accept:'application/json'},signal:AbortSignal.timeout(6000)});if(!r.ok)throw Error(`HTTP_${r.status}`);const rows=await r.json();bonds.push(...parseCbRegistry(rows,{sourceUrl,kind,capturedAt}));sources.push({kind,sourceUrl,rows:rows.length});}
+      catch(error){errors.push({kind,code:/^HTTP_\d+$/.test(error.message)?error.message:'CB_REGISTRY_UNAVAILABLE_OR_SCHEMA'});}
+    }
+    const payload={checkedAt:capturedAt,bonds,sources,errors,status:errors.length?(bonds.length?'partial':'failed'):'ok'};
+    if(bonds.length&&!await write(key,payload,errors.length?3600000:12*3600000))return {...payload,storageStatus:'failed'};
+    return payload;
+  })().finally(()=>cbTasks.delete(key));
+  cbTasks.set(key,task);return task;
+}
